   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Proverbs",
     "texto": [
      "A proverb expresses a popular truth in few words: **Quem não arrisca não petisca** (he who doesn't risk, doesn't win). **Mais vale prevenir do que remediar** (better to prevent than to cure). **Mais vale tarde do que nunca** (better late than never)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Expressions with body and mind",
     "texto": [
      "**Estar com a cabeça nas nuvens** (to be in the clouds, distracted). **Pôr as cartas na mesa** (to put the cards on the table, to speak plainly). **Fazer das tripas coração** (to make a heart out of one's guts, to pull oneself together)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Situation expressions",
     "texto": [
      "**Estar em maus lençóis** (to be in a mess, in trouble). It's used for a difficult situation, not for a bed."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
